utu.be/t4n9MAP2_14?t=2436"]},{"field":"gp","text":"He played 77, 72 and 71 games in the last three seasons. That clean record is above Yahoo's 68.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"He is a 30-year-old veteran on a bad team without its own pick, so there is some March rest risk.","sources":["https://youtu.be/uRsfijpBPok?t=1851"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}